  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5910.04 EMS I/C Training Program Approval Process",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5910.04 EMS I/C Training Program Approval Process.\n\n(a) The completed “Authority to Establish Courses” form shall be approved in accordance with RSA 541-A:29.\n\n(b) The EMS I/C shall be notified, in writing, of the approval or denial within 10 days of receipt by the division.\n\n(c) The division shall notify the following of the training program’s approval:\n\n(1) The EMS I/C requesting course authorization; and\n\n(2) The course medical director or his or her designee.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5900.html"
}
